  "book_code": "GEN",
  "chapter": 38,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass at that time, that Judah went down from his brethren, and turned in to a certain Adullamite, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Hirah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Judah saw there a daughter of a certain Canaanite, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Shuah; and he took her, and went in to her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she conceived, and bore a son; and he called his name Er.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she conceived again, and bore a son; and she called his name Onan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And she yet again conceived, and bore a son; and called his name Shelah: and he was at Chezib, when she bore him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Judah took a wife for Er his first-born, whose name ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Tamar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Er, Judah's first-born, was wicked in the sight of the LORD; and the LORD slew him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Judah said to Onan, Go in to thy brother's wife, and marry her, and raise up seed to thy brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Onan knew that the seed would not be his: and it came to pass, when he went in to his brother's wife, that he frustrated the purpose, lest he should give seed to his brother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the thing which he did displeased the LORD: wherefore he slew him also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.38.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.38.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then said Judah to Tamar his daughter-in-law, Remain a widow at thy father's house, till Shelah my son shall be grown; (for he said, Lest perhaps he die also as his brethren ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "did",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ":) and Tamar went and dwelt in her father's house.",
