          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a kid from the flock: and she said, Wilt thou give ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
